Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Lift.lean-142-/-- **A lift** of the framework `x₀` along `y`, to first order in `π`: every listed edge of the deformed
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Lift.lean-143-positions `x₀ + π • y` has quadrance one. At `R = ZMod (p²)`, `π = p`, the deformations `x₀ + p • y` are
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Lift.lean-144-exactly the configurations with the residues of `x₀`, so `IsLift p x₀ L y` says "a lift modulo `p²`". -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Lift.lean:145:def IsLift (π : R) (x₀ y : V → R × R) (L : List (StressedEdge V R)) : Prop :=
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Lift.lean-146-  ∀ e ∈ L, quad ((x₀ e.src + π • y e.src) - (x₀ e.dst + π • y e.dst)) = 1
