Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-206-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-207-/-- **Condition 6** (`[SokolovVoronov2025]`: "There are no trichromatic vertices of degree greater than 3"), read on an arc map: a
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-208-point carrying exactly three colours has degree at most `3` (its degree is its number of sectors, `HasDegree`). FS106-TS-T's last
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-209-clause (`Plane/SVMap`). -/
