Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/HexRing.lean-63-(property (ii)). Property (i) — two points of `ω(u)` off `Γ` at distance `1` have different colours — is validity. -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/HexRing.lean:64:def RingProper (u : ℂ) : Prop :=
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/HexRing.lean-65-  (F.Γ ∩ sphere u 1).Finite ∧
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/HexRing.lean-66-    ∀ ψ ψ' X X' Y Y', dist (ringPt u ψ) (ringPt u ψ') = 1 → F.IsChangePoint u ψ X X' → F.IsChangePoint u ψ' Y Y' →
