### HadwigerNelson.Plane.ArcMap.SaturatedAt
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/LocalMap.lean-288-def essColours (w : ℂ) : Set (Fin k) := {j | 0 < upperDensityAt (F.region j) w}
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/LocalMap.lean-289-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/LocalMap.lean-290-/-- `w` is an **essential boundary point**: its essential multicolour has at least two colours. -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/LocalMap.lean-291-def IsEssBoundary (w : ℂ) : Prop := 2 ≤ (F.essColours w).ncard
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/LocalMap.lean-292-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/LocalMap.lean-293-/-- The map is **saturated at `w`**: each colour of `P(w)` has a point of its essential support at distance exactly
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/LocalMap.lean-294-`1` from `w`. -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/LocalMap.lean:295:def SaturatedAt (w : ℂ) : Prop := ∀ j ∈ F.essColours w, ∃ x ∈ essSupport (F.region j), dist x w = 1
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/LocalMap.lean-296-
