### HadwigerNelson.Plane.ArcMap.Terminal
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-162-    ∀ᶠ r in 𝓝[>] (0 : ℝ), hornSet v α s₁ s₂ r ⊆ shadow (F.region g) ∩ shadow (F.region h)
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-163-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-164-/-- **Terminal on `U`**: no MERGE, MERGE-RAY or SHAVE is available at any point of `U` (a fragment's local form; FS112-BOWTIE
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-165-is terminal on a neighbourhood of its three named points). -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-166-def TerminalOn (U : Set ℂ) : Prop := ∀ v ∈ U, ¬ F.MergeAvailable v ∧ ¬ F.RayAvailable v ∧ ¬ F.ShaveAvailable v
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-167-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-168-/-- **A terminal map** (FS110-N4-PROP): no MERGE, MERGE-RAY or SHAVE is available at any point. -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean:169:def Terminal : Prop := F.TerminalOn univ
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-170-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-171-/-- **A stuck vertex** (FS110-N4-STUCK's hypothesis): no move is available at `v`, and some colour has at least two sectors
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Basic.lean-172-there. -/
