Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Procedure.lean-2954-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Procedure.lean-2955-/-- Something is left to do at `v`: a move is available, or a maximal unit arc about `v` is neither (Q) nor (R2). -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Procedure.lean:2956:def Todo (F : ArcMap k) (v : ℂ) : Prop := F.MoveAt v ∨ F.badCount v ≠ 0
