Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/CPColouring.lean-58-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/CPColouring.lean-59-/-- The law is invariant under every rotation about the origin. -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/CPColouring.lean:60:def CPColouring.RotationInvariant (c : CPColouring k) : Prop := ∀ θ : ℝ, c.law.map (rotCol θ) = c.law
