### HadwigerNelson.Plane.IsAdmissible
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-42-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-43-/-! ## Families, covers, maximal covers, selections -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-44-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-45-/-- Each class of `C` lies in the matching class of `D` up to a null set. -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-46-def AeLE (C D : Fin k → Set ℂ) : Prop := ∀ j, C j ≤ᵐ[volume] D j
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-47-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-48-/-- An admissible family: every class is measurable and has null unit pairs. -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean:49:def IsAdmissible (C : Fin k → Set ℂ) : Prop := ∀ j, MeasurableSet (C j) ∧ UnitPairsNull (C j)
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-50-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-51-/-- An **admissible cover**: an admissible family whose union has full measure. -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/Cover.lean-52-def IsAeCover (C : Fin k → Set ℂ) : Prop := IsAdmissible C ∧ ∀ᵐ x ∂volume, ∃ j, x ∈ C j
### HadwigerNelson.Plane.IsRegOf
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean-18-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean-19-open Complex Real Set Filter Topology Metric
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean-20-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean-21-/-! ## FS106-TS-T on a square inside a fragment (for `disc1_local`) -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean-22-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean-23-/-- A **region of a family of classes**: a pair `(j, C)` with `C` a connected component of `cls j` (`AeProperRegions.IsRegion` with
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean-24-the classes given directly, so that a fragment's classes, which need not fill the plane, can be read). -/
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean:25:def IsRegOf {k : ℕ} (cls : Fin k → Set ℂ) (q : Fin k × Set ℂ) : Prop := ∃ y ∈ cls q.1, q.2 = connectedComponentIn (cls q.1) y
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean-26-
Proofs/HadwigerNelson/Plane/ValidMap/Dense.lean-27-section IsRegOf
